s enviar currículum vitae sin omitir foto, referencias ni remuneración pretendida', 1, 'Capital Federal, Buenos Aires', 'Presencial', 'Full-time', '13-04-2026', '13-04-2026 12:53:28', '13-04-2026 13:06:21', '2026-04-13', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-13T00:00:00-03:00', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 22, 2610, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1020, 'Aviso Talento', 'bumeran', 'talento', 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.bumeran.com.ar/empleos/1118229171.html', '2026-04-14T07:05:54.893309');
